e. Mental and spiritual.
(3) In carrying out duties and functions as referred to in paragraph (1), the Regional Government cooperates with Government Agencies, other Regional Governments, and the community.
(4) Further provisions regarding procedures for handling services for women and children from acts of violence as referred to in paragraph (1), paragraph (2) and paragraph (3), shall be regulated by Regent Regulation.

